<title>USA: New Orleans newspaper wins Pulitzer.</title>
<headline>New Orleans newspaper wins Pulitzer.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-04-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Pulitzer Prize for public service in journalism was awarded Monday to The Times-Picayune newspaper of New Orleans for its &quot;comprehensive series analysing the conditions that threaten the world's supply of fish.&quot;</p>
<p>The Pulitzer Prizes in journalism, drama, letters and music are awarded annually on the recommendation of the Pulitzer Prize Board at Columbia University.</p>
</text>
